    <p>
      You can change your choice at any time in the website footer. Withdrawing
      consent does not affect the lawfulness of processing before withdrawal.
    </p>

    <h2>13. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy. For substantive changes, existing users
      will be notified by email at least 30 days before they take effect.
      Version and effective date are shown at the top.
    </p>

